# Interview Explanation

“NSG works at Layer 3/4 for IP and port filtering, Firewall provides centralized advanced network security, and WAF protects web applications at Layer 7 against OWASP attacks like SQL Injection and XSS. Layer 4 handles TCP/UDP traffic, while Layer 7 handles HTTP/HTTPS application traffic and performs intelligent routing and inspection.”
